{"run_id": "full-r1", "item_id": "coding-003", "category": "coding", "title": "Merge labeled intervals", "difficulty": "easy", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_high", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning high)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "high", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 210960, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": null, "output_tokens": 27891, "reasoning_tokens": 27672, "input_tokens": 189, "search_tokens": null, "cached_input_tokens": 0}, "answer_chars": 840, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 98142, "detail": {"score": 1.0, "total": 12, "failures": [], "pass": true, "load_error": null, "passed": 12}, "workflow_id": "0sfj53191cd6-d029-11f1-9071-46362399c705", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj51db5858-d029-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:09:05-0500", "answer": "```python\ndef merge_intervals(intervals: list[tuple[int, int, str]]) -> list[tuple[int, int, list[str]]]:\n    \"\"\"Merge overlapping or touching half-open intervals and collect sorted labels.\"\"\"\n    prepared: list[tuple[int, int, str]] = []\n    for start, end, label in intervals:\n        if start >= end:\n            raise ValueError(\"start must be less than end\")\n        prepared.append((start, end, label))\n\n    prepared.sort(key=lambda item: (item[0], item[1]))\n\n    merged = []  # each item: [start, end, set_of_labels]\n    for start, end, label in prepared:\n        if merged and start <= merged[-1][1]:\n            merged[-1][1] = max(merged[-1][1], end)\n            merged[-1][2].add(label)\n        else:\n            merged.append([start, end, {label}])\n\n    return [(start, end, sorted(labels)) for start, end, labels in merged]\n```"}
