r for Human Rights, former judge on the International Criminal Court, and currently serves as an ad hoc judge on the International Court of Justice. [Source: NobelPrize.org press release](https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/peace/2026/press-release/) | [Al Jazeera](https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/9/2026-nobel-peace-prize-awarded-to-navi-pillay) | [PBS/AP](https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/watch-live-winner-of-the-2026-nobel-peace-prize-is) | [Britannica](https://www.britannica.com/topic/2026-Nobel-Prize-winners)\n\nANSWER: Literature: Anne Carson; Peace: Navi Pillay", "rescored": "grounding citation rule v3 (URL, website or provider reference link)"}
