{"run_id": "full-r1", "item_id": "grounding-012", "category": "grounding", "title": "Mistral Large 4 announcement and size", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 12306, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": 6, "output_tokens": 630, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 813, "search_tokens": 28378, "cached_input_tokens": null}, "answer_chars": 1737, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"pass": true, "score": 1.0, "extracted": "2026-10-06; 1.05 trillion (1T) total; 52 billion active", "expected": "2026-10-06; 1 trillion total; 52 billion active", "answer_line_found": true, "pattern_misses": [], "cited": true, "citation_count": 6}, "workflow_id": "0sfj30b1f0c0-d02c-11f1-89ad-1a5d2f4e051b", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2ff16ea8-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:26:16-0500", "answer": "Based on my research, here's what I found:\n\n**Announcement Date:** Mistral AI announced Mistral Large 4 (nicknamed \"Le Chonk\") on **October 6, 2026**, as a public preview through Mistral Studio.\n\n**Parameters:** According to Mistral's official announcement blog post, the model is described as \"a 1 trillion-parameter natively multimodal model with 52 billion active parameters.\"Mistral's official documentation/model card provides more precise figures: **1.05 trillion (1.05T) total parameters** and **52 billion (52B) active parameters**, plus a 1.6 billion parameter vision encoder.**Note on discrepancy:** There was some initial confusion in early coverage. The original announcement on October 6, 2026 initially stated \"49 billion active parameters,\" but Mistral subsequently updated the announcement to say \"52 billion active parameters.\" The model documentation consistently lists 1.05T total and 52B active. According to later analysis, the 49B figure refers to active parameters in the expert layers only, while 52B includes the embedding and output layers as well.**Sources:**\n- Mistral AI official announcement: https://mistral.ai/news/mistral-large-4/ (\"ML4 is a 1 trillion-parameter natively multimodal model with 52 billion active parameters\")\n- Mistral AI official documentation: https://docs.mistral.ai/models/mistral-large-4 (\"It features 52B active parameters and 1.05T total parameters, and a 1.6B vision encoder\")\n- Mixed-News analysis of the 49B vs 52B discrepancy: https://mixed-news.com/en/mistral-large-4-49-billion-52-billion-active-parameters-blog-docs/\n- Lindy.ai analysis of the parameter count change: https://www.lindy.ai/blog/mistral-large-4\n\nANSWER: 2026-10-06; 1.05 trillion (1T) total; 52 billion active", "rescored": "grounding citation rule v3 (URL, website or provider reference link)"}
