ductor-oss/conductor](https://github.com/conductor-oss/conductor/releases) \u2014 shows the release list with v3.32.5 marked as \"Latest\"\n2. [GitHub Release v3.32.5](https://github.com/conductor-oss/conductor/releases/tag/v3.32.5) \u2014 confirms \"Latest\" badge and release date of Sep 25\n\nANSWER: v3.32.5", "rescored": "grounding citation rule v3 (URL, website or provider reference link)"}
