{"run_id": "full-r1", "item_id": "grounding-005", "category": "grounding", "title": "2026 US Open women's singles final score", "difficulty": "medium", "repeat": 1, "config_id": "l4_off", "config_label": "Mistral Large 4 (reasoning off)", "model": "mistral-large-4", "reasoning_effort": "none", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "api_ok": true, "error": null, "latency_ms": 15684, "turns": 1, "retries": 0, "usage": {"search_calls": 6, "output_tokens": 666, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "input_tokens": 809, "search_tokens": 31429, "cached_input_tokens": null}, "answer_chars": 1365, "finish_reason": "stop", "thinking_chars": 0, "detail": {"pass": true, "score": 1.0, "extracted": "Elena Rybakina def. Aryna Sabalenka 6\u20134, 5\u20137, 6\u20132", "expected": "Elena Rybakina def. Aryna Sabalenka 6-4, 5-7, 6-2", "answer_line_found": true, "pattern_misses": [], "cited": true, "citation_count": 0}, "workflow_id": "0sfj30337b99-d02c-11f1-ba7a-56adf5b8ca14", "parent_workflow_id": "0sfj2ff12083-d02c-11f1-aff9-321d2204384c", "recorded_at": "2026-10-24T23:26:19-0500", "answer": "I have confirmed the result from multiple authoritative sources, including the official US Open website, WTA, BBC Sport, ESPN, Associated Press, and USA Today.\n\n**Elena Rybakina** of Kazakhstan won the 2026 US Open women's singles final, defeating two-time defending champion **Aryna Sabalenka** of Belarus in three sets, **6\u20134, 5\u20137, 6\u20132**, on Saturday, September 12, 2026, at Arthur Ashe Stadium in New York. The win gave Rybakina her first US Open title and third Grand Slam crown of her career (and second of 2026, having also won the Australian Open). It also confirmed her rise to world No. 1, ending Sabalenka's 99-week reign at the top of the rankings.\n\n**Sources cited:**\n- US Open (official): \"Rybakina defeats two-time defending champion Sabalenka to win 2026 US Open\" \u2014 usopen.org\n- WTA (official): \"The new No. 1 has a new US Open trophy: Rybakina ends Sabalenka's reign\" \u2014 wtatennis.com\n- BBC Sport: \"US Open 2026 results: Elena Rybakina beats Aryna Sabalenka to win New York title\" \u2014 bbc.com/sport\n- ESPN: \"Elena Rybakina, world's No. 1, secures first US Open title\" \u2014 espn.com\n- Associated Press: \"Elena Rybakina beats Aryna Sabalenka to win the US Open title and punctuate her rise to No. 1\" \u2014 apnews.com\n- USA Today: \"Elena Rybakina defeats Aryna Sabalenka in US Open final\" \u2014 usatoday.com\n\nANSWER: Elena Rybakina def. Aryna Sabalenka 6\u20134, 5\u20137, 6\u20132", "rescored": "grounding citation rule v3 (URL, website or provider reference link)"}
