014 6-4 | 5-7 | 6-2\" [zT73rxxA]\n- Wikipedia: \"2026 US Open (tennis)\" [wligu5Kf]\n- CBS Sports: \"US Open 2026 results: Alexander Zverev, Elena Rybakina win singles titles in New York\" [hFacTZxR]\n\nANSWER: Elena Rybakina def. Aryna Sabalenka 6-4, 5-7, 6-2", "rescored": "grounding citation rule v3 (URL, website or provider reference link)"}
